## How to supply a draft assertion fact

```turtle
[] a dcterms:Standard ;
    rdfs:label "Management asserts that the controls described in this binder's System Description (01) were suitably designed and, where marked TESTED in the Control Matrix (03), operated effectively." ;
    dcterms:creator "Jane Doe, VP Engineering" ;
    dcterms:date "2026-08-18"^^xsd:date .
```

This is a *draft* for internal review — the real, signed Management
Assertion that accompanies an actual SOC 2 report is a legal document
prepared with the engaged CPA firm, not something this template's output
should be submitted as-is.
